tool_notes = Antigravity sends Gemini function declarations inside request.tools[]; each tool file stores the exact request.tools[] wrapper observed for that function in the agent request. This is a routine refresh of the interactive tmux capture flow against 1.1.1 (previous successful interactive capture was against 1.0.16, committed in 7dbf059; a 1.1.0 interactive capture was also taken locally but never committed). Tool schemas from this interactive run are byte-identical in content to the non-interactive 1.1.1 run in ../VERSION (only trace_lines differ, as expected since interactive/non-interactive traces land on different log line numbers) -- no interactive-only tool variants were observed this round. The interactive prompt capture (prompts/gemini-3-flash-agent-interactive.md) shows the same "Google DeepMind" -> "Google Deepmind" recasing noted in ../VERSION, and is otherwise unchanged from the prior interactive capture.
